Package: sparky-stereo-theme-editor
Architecture: any
Depends: gzip, kde-cli-tools, kscreen, qt6-svg-plugins, ${misc:Depends}, ${shlibs:Depends}
Description: Icon and theme authoring with a stereo preview
  Edit named SVG parts with depth, inspect both views, and save an icon
  theme project copy at the theme's declared sizes. The preview uses
  Stereo KWin and keeps the editor controls on the screen plane.
  Original system themes are read only. Ten interface languages are included.
